# --- Repository slimming (rnd_plan.md issue 1) ---
# Publication/paper artifacts and historical benchmark payloads. These are
# outputs of the research/paper pipeline, not runtime sources; keep them out
# of the code repository so they do not pollute agent search and bootstrap
# indexes. Work continues in the local copies; re-host assets in a data repo
# or object store if they need sharing.
paper/
hact_resubmission/
patents/
Adaptive_HACT_v5_Research_Paper.pdf
HACT_v5_Review_and_Productivity_Redesign.pdf
docs/agent-platform/validation/
experiments/first-commit-20261111/
# Agent-benchmark raw trial outputs: per-run CLI state dirs, replay logs, and
# embedded fixture git objects are regenerated by
# scripts/bench-agent-cli-replay.py; only the durable harness + aggregated
# evidence (DESIGN.md, gateway/, evidence.json, report.json, trials.json)
# are tracked.
experiments/agent-benchmark-20261119/cli-replay/trials/*/
experiments/agent-benchmark-20261119/cli-replay/fixture/
